cff-version: 1.2.0
title: NodeGram
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - name: NODE Group
    website: https://www.nodegroup.ir/
repository-code: https://github.com/NODE-Group-IR/NodeGram
url: https://www.nodegroup.ir/
abstract: >-
  NodeGram is a secure serverless Telegram Bot API gateway for networks that
  cannot reach Telegram directly. It runs on DigitalOcean Functions and
  forwards authenticated JSON envelopes to api.telegram.org.
  Tagline: Telegram reaches your code.
keywords:
  - telegram
  - bot-api
  - digitalocean
  - serverless
  - nodejs
  - Telegram
  - Bot API
  - gateway
license: MIT
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-07"
